English
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

■ You may

・Use this tool, free of charge, on avatars you own or have a valid right to
  use. Personal and commercial use alike.
・Distribute and sell avatars protected with this tool without restriction.
  No credit or notification is required.
・Modify the tool for your own use.

■ You may not

・Redistribute, re-upload, sell, or distribute modified versions of the tool
  itself (scripts, shader templates and bundled documentation).
・Use the tool on avatars you do not have the right to use.

  Note: this package contains portions derived from MIT-licensed work. The
  restriction above does not apply to those portions, which remain under the
  MIT License. See NOTICE.md for what they are and for the full licence text.

■ Disclaimer

This tool is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. The author accepts no liability for any damage arising from its use.

In particular:

・The tool deforms your mesh. Before uploading, always verify in your own
  environment that the avatar looks correct and restores correctly.
・The tool does not prevent extraction. See README.md, or THREAT_MODEL.md for
  the detail, on what it does and does not do.
・If the password is lost, there is no way to restore an avatar that has
  already been uploaded. Keep it somewhere safe.
